    name="3DxVERSE / LDT4SSC — solution implementation of the EDIC LDT RA"
    id="id-603d3a06dfb648258c997b561f2a8b2a"
    documentation="Solution-implementation view: how iLabs' 3DxVERSE / LDT4SSC implementations realize the EDIC LDT Reference Architecture.&#xA;&#xA;READING THE VIEW&#xA;  Upper bands  — EDIC's own elements, in their own places. Nothing here was modified, moved or renamed.&#xA;  Lower band   — the iLabs additions (this contribution).&#xA;  Right rail   — evidence and mapping confidence.&#xA;&#xA;MAPPING CONFIDENCE&#xA;  Every relationship carries ilabs.mapping.status. `verified` means iLabs has deployed evidence AND the modelling lead has confirmed the mapping; `verify` means the mapping is proposed and not yet confirmed. One row of nine is `verified` today. The honesty is deliberate — the model carries its own confidence.&#xA;&#xA;Contributed under Issue #7 (&quot;LDT Toolbox as solution architecture&quot;)."
